# No redundant Shopify sections

## Before creating a new section or asset

1. Search the **active** theme for an existing `nf-*` / `bf-*` / `j14-*` section or shared pattern that already does the job.
2. Prefer extending the existing section with settings over copy-paste under a new name.
3. If NeoFizz and Ballena already share a feature (same filenames under each theme), **update both** or document intentional divergence in the theme `design/` notes — do not fork silently.

## Twin themes

When editing shared files such as `nf-water-wave.*`:

- Apply the same change in `fizz-neofizz-theme/` and `fizz-ballena-theme/` unless the user scopes to one theme.
- Keep identical filenames and APIs so merchants and agents can reason once.

## Do not

- Scaffold a near-duplicate “new” divider/carousel/hero when one already exists.
- Push only one twin and leave the other stale without saying so.
